stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NoPlan: User registers

    NoPlan --> Checkout: Selects a plan
    Checkout --> Active: Payment succeeds via Stripe

    state Active {
        [*] --> InUse
        InUse --> QuotaCheck: API request
        QuotaCheck --> InUse: Within limits
        QuotaCheck --> QuotaExceeded: Over limit
        QuotaExceeded --> InUse: Wait for renewal
    }

    Active --> Renewed: Auto-renewal at billing cycle
    Renewed --> Active: Usage reset, period extended

    Active --> PendingCancel: User cancels
    PendingCancel --> Active: User resumes before period end
    PendingCancel --> Cancelled: Billing period ends

    Active --> PlanChangeScheduled: User selects different plan
    PlanChangeScheduled --> Active: Change applied at next billing

    Cancelled --> NoPlan: Access revoked

    note right of Active
        Quotas enforce limits on
        batch and live processing
    end note

    note right of PendingCancel
        User retains access until
        end of paid period
    end note
